&lt;p&gt;But we also don&amp;rsquo;t want the client to be global. I still want to let my transactions run concurrently and on different clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the exact problem &lt;code&gt;AsyncLocalStorage&lt;/code&gt; solves.&lt;/p&gt;
